{
  "_about": "Tender Ruwen, the Tender of Ashcrown (Ch5, speaker `tender` shown as 'Tender Ruwen': opens the crown pavilion, paints the gilt line, opens Kahre's chamber, hands Asha the key; the same speaker id serves the later temples' Tenders, Coilspire's in Ch8-9), about 52, a woman. Composed, tired, kind; grey-streaked black hair in a low knot; the Order's ivory robe (a long-sleeved wrap top over an ankle skirt) with the skirt's cloth greyed with ash (soot on the hems, act1_ch05.md), a gold-leaf sash wound twice, a lacquer-black stole panel to the shin, sandals. No reach-bands. (M3-CHR-533.) Face sliders relative to the MakeHuman donor (ADR 0021: 1.0 / 0.0 = unchanged). Keys starting with '_' are read by the villager_* modules (villager_hair, villager_costume, villager_textures, write_materials, villager_clips), not by bb_params.",
